    "title": "Galaxiga Arcade Shooting Game",
    "description": "Immerse yourself in the nostalgic realm of Galaxiga: Classic Arcade Space Shooter, the retro Galaga game that takes you on an exhilarating journey through a galaxy fraught with danger.\r\nGalaxiga stands as a testament to the timeless appeal of classic arcade space shooters. Galaxiga offers a great experience that combines the simple yet addictive gameplay of the past with the polish of modern technology. Get ready to defend the galaxy in this galactic battle of epic proportions, reminiscent of the legendary Galactica, Galaga classic, and Galaxia battles.\r\nEach level in Galaxiga challenges you to obliterate wave after wave of space enemies, ensuring that your shooting abilities and tactical skills are paramount to safeguarding your galaxy.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Gorgeous space shooter Pixel graphic reminds old school galactic war games \r\n- Over 500 campaigns, confront the intimidating Boss of Galaxy battle, pushing you to the limits of your strategic prowess\r\n- Explore diverse strategies to enhance your spaceship's might and elevate its power to new heights.\r\n- Build your guild to compete on the leaderboards and win big rewards\r\n- True space battle experience like the retro Galaga war\r\n- Online shooting games: thrilling and engaging PvP game mode,  co-op with friends, gather your squadron team, and mark your name on the global leader board.\r\n- High-quality images optimized for tablets and large screens. \r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n- Slide the screen to control your spaceship and dodge the enemy's bullets, alien invaders' attack, battle with Galaxian space invaders\r\n- Use coins and gems to upgrade or evolve your spaceship, and space crafts to fight giant enemies and alien invaders.\r\n- Use appropriate spaceships and strategies for each level and boss.\r\n- Remember to use a power-up item or booster item. They will help you complete it easier.\r\n\r\nIf you are a big fan of arcade retro shooter games like Galaxia, Galaxian, Galaga & Galactica with new modern shooting way, then Galaxiga: Classic Arcade Space Shooter - Free Games is the perfect game for you.\r\nDownload the outstanding Galaxiga: Classic Arcade Space Shooter, retro Galactica shooting game now! \r\nWhat are you waiting for?\r\n\r\n<p>Download here: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fgalaxiga.onelink.me%2FkZFP%2F&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0W_8ziRJvDiyz4db_qL5lk\">https://galaxiga.onelink.me/kZFP/</a></p>\r\n<p>Join us on Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fgalaxiga.game&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0Kjdb31Vh-_A5B-qmQ8Ium\">https://www.facebook.com/galaxiga.game</a></p>\r\n<p>Join our Community: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fgroups%2FGalaxigAGame%2F&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw2IwrvDAo7Q3di0fh2vOFb6\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/GalaxigAGame/</a></p>",
